#: ../../guide/dispatcher.rst:41
msgid "The dispatcher is a :class:`~aiorubi.dispatcher.router.Router`, so all observer registration methods and ``include_router`` work on it. Unlike a plain router it **cannot** be included into another router — setting ``parent_router`` raises :class:`RuntimeError`."
msgstr ""

